---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Research"
  description="Peer-reviewed publications, conference presentations, and current research focus areas of Maxwell O. Chibuogwu, PhD — plant pathology, mycotoxins, and Fusarium genomics."
>
  <article class="research-page">
    <header class="page-header">
      <div class="container-narrow">
        <p class="eyebrow reveal">Research</p>
        <h1 class="reveal reveal-delay-1">
          Plant pathology, mycotoxins, and the genomics of <em>Fusarium</em>.
        </h1>
        <p class="lede reveal reveal-delay-2">
          A working record of peer-reviewed publications, conference work, and
          current research threads at the USDA Dairy Forage Research Center.
          Updated as new outputs land.
        </p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- ============================================================
         CURRENT FOCUS
         ============================================================ -->
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container-narrow">
        <h2>Current focus</h2>
        <ul class="focus-list">
          <li>
            <strong>Predictive modeling of mycotoxin accumulation</strong>
            in silage corn fields under variable climate conditions.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Whole-genome sequencing</strong> of <em>Fusarium</em>
            species complex isolates using Oxford Nanopore platforms,
            with downstream <em>de novo</em> assembly, antiSMASH-based
            secondary metabolite analysis, and chemical profiling for
            mycotoxin biosynthesis pathways.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Postbiotic additives</strong> and their effect on
            anaerobic fermentation and forage quality of corn and alfalfa
            silage — in collaboration with university and industry partners.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Fungicide resistance</strong> evolution and the impact of
            climate on pathogen population dynamics.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Method development</strong> for metagenomic-quality DNA
            extraction from complex plant–microbial matrices.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============================================================
         PUBLICATIONS
         ============================================================ -->
    <section class="section section-tinted">
      <div class="container-narrow">
        <h2>Peer-reviewed publications</h2>

        <ol class="pub-list">
          <li>
            <p>
              <strong>Chibuogwu, M. O.</strong>, Panke-Buisse, K., Stonoha-Arther, C.,
              &amp; McClure, J. (2026). <em>Complete Reference Genome Resource
              Announcement: De Novo Genome Assembly and Functional Annotation
              for the Plant Pathogen</em> Fusarium cerealis. <em>Phytopathology
              First Look</em>.
            </p>
            <p class="pub-link">
              <a href="https://doi.org/10.1094/PHYTOFR-09-25-0103-A" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                doi.org/10.1094/PHYTOFR-09-25-0103-A ↗
