            </p>
          </li>
        </ol>

        <h3 class="subhead">In progress / under review</h3>
        <ol class="pub-list">
          <li>
            <p>
              <strong>Chibuogwu, M. O.</strong>, Panke-Buisse, K., Olson, E. G.,
              Bleier, J., Scheaffer, A. N., &amp; Ricke, S. C. How a postbiotic
              yeast fermentate influences anaerobic fermentation and forage
              quality of corn and alfalfa. <em>(In progress)</em>
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <p>
              <strong>Chibuogwu, M. O.</strong>, Panke-Buisse, K., Bleier, J.,
              Stonoha-Arther, C., Costello, M., &amp; McClure, J. Efficient
