              posters.
            </dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>2025</dt>
            <dd>
              <strong>Mycological Society of America Annual Conference</strong> —
              Poster: <em>Draft genome sequence and de novo assembly of
              mycotoxin-producing</em> Fusarium cerealis <em>isolate associated
              with ear rot of silage corn</em>.
              <a href="/images/msa-poster.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="poster-link">
                View poster ↗
              </a>
              <figure class="poster-preview">
                <a href="/images/msa-poster.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
                  <img
                    src="/images/msa-poster.png"
                    alt="MSA 2025 poster: Draft Genome Sequence of Fusarium cerealis"
                    loading="lazy"
                    width="900"
                  />
                </a>
                <figcaption>
                  MSA Annual Conference 2025 — click to view full resolution.
